{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：06:34 2026-11-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：06:34 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：06:34 2026-11-16 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd24283957be2f3c9affd3d45d64c1df/2026-11/UC2.jpeg\"/><p>今日（16日）凌晨零時許，警方接獲途人報案，指在順天邨天柱樓對開，發現一名男子手部流血，聲稱遭人斬傷。人員接報到場，李男手部及面部受傷，其後被送往聯合醫院治理。警方將案列「傷人」，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>據了解，李男因金錢問題與人發生爭執，其間遭約6至7人以刀及膠尺襲擊，手部及面部受傷，兇徒呈兇後逃去。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T22:48:43.712418+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T22:34:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T23:54:12.612689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T22:42:11.604736+00:00","content_hash":"7383839cca29c8fb030cc470beada51b5ad728c4d1e33c8d6e0a65c468bc9497","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}